{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ce507ab06461dca5ce72349723b2858a74bd9f8f0a35b25cab792d9748d16ebb", "ja": "公演は大成功し、打ち上げのバーベキューを\n楽しむ一同。やよいは、海が近くにある生活\nを想像して絵を描き、先生に褒められたと語\nる。メンバーは楽しい時間を過ごしつつ、ユ\nニットのこれからに思いを馳せるのだった。", "zh": "公演大获成功，大家享用着庆功宴上的烧烤。弥生讲述了自己想象着在海边生活的样子并画了下来，还得到了老师的表扬。成员们一边度过愉快的时光，一边憧憬着组合的未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4e7453eac3d73fd900050d3aa066b716de6ae834b8d716c532fbe30a57189f26", "ja": "（3人の公演は、大成功で終わった。だが新しい\n仕事も来て、新ユニットの夏はまだ終わりそうにない）", "zh": "（3人的公演圆满成功地结束了。不过新的工作也来了，新组合的夏天似乎还远未结束。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4e4371a5110b5cdd97f873d226102215369095526f1e686ef1c7fca7071a8102", "ja": "（そんな熱い夏を乗り切るため、BBQ会を開催した。\nがっつり食べてみんなに力をつけてもらおう！）", "zh": "（为了熬过这样炎热的夏天，我们举办了烧烤会。让大家好好吃一顿，积攒力气吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "e40c344af337e0f5dba3da0e8b268ca891112fbfa12069e801a44f9c1ae84f98", "ja": "わあ～！　お肉、焼けてきましたね！\nいいにおいです～！", "zh": "哇～！肉烤得差不多了呢！\n好香啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "5ad949ae6a0729b3863fa61a2351b37fe19d0354e4be46e790dc5d66bc7c384d", "ja": "うん、すっごくおいしそうに焼けてる！\nやよい、春香！　こっちはもう食べられそうだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，看起来烤得特别香！\n弥生、春香！这边已经可以吃了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "f6a5d7f5e58617d7ec33c941c380eb9e35ef72f4e03d46f4fe165d74839c9df3", "ja": "デザートにマシュマロも用意してあるから、\nお楽しみに♪　それじゃ、いただきまーす♪", "zh": "甜点还准备了棉花糖，\n敬请期待♪ 那么，我开动啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "7e21165a64d86811ad45af795f0f1aa071e5d73ba7f1ccd3e706e58d669402d0", "ja": "いただきまーす！\n……うん！　すっごくジューシー！", "zh": "我开动啦！\n……嗯！肉汁超级多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "370fe534b2d12caba5a139415f6778fca45f840c85e99a55460b79e031a7ab69", "ja": "んー！　口の中に、お肉がいっぱいで……\nとっても幸せですー！", "zh": "嗯——！嘴里满满都是肉……\n感觉好幸福哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "794509e4b118d4d34c8c83d31804066f0f5607b92f3b1801c3186b79ba282798", "ja": "ふふっ♪　こうして外で食べると、\nなんだかいつもより美味しく感じるね。", "zh": "呵呵♪ 像这样在外面吃，总觉得比平时更好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "20d24c9eb8cf81bcb8abc8ec35c76cc8129e544a15291a05dfa4a28440f0d2e9", "ja": "{$P$}も、食べて食べて！\nこの肉、すっごくおいしいぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}也快吃快吃！\n这肉超级好吃的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cfec4e9f0a14ef291ef460060b20445a9473a21253d42abd66f53fb862169446", "ja": "うん、なかなかいい値段したからな……。\nでも俺は、こっちの野菜からいただくよ。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟价格不便宜嘛……\n不过我先吃这边的蔬菜吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "c8b9a0894afcc3718d76601ec3ae12e56667c6101ac15afc2afc48a3d50f013c", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}さん、\nお肉まだたくさんありますよ？　心配しなくても……。", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生，肉还多着呢？不用担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d5f3bed9de26e1d0fb9792b1ff910534938b58305b330a1ea7a37d68e936e596", "ja": "いや、健康診断が近くて……\nうん！　炭火で焼いた玉ねぎ、うまいな！", "zh": "不是，健康检查快到了……\n嗯！炭火烤的洋葱真好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "47ab848eea4e8a83e75a97b4fd7bec8b9065b673e7c4958386dae335d2c65fa4", "ja": "そっかー、大人っていろいろ大変なんだね。\nでも、そういうことなら、遠慮しなくていいのかな？", "zh": "这样啊——大人还真是有各种各样的烦恼呢。\n不过，既然是这样，那我就不用客气了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "ef33e1133bf3f2c3913bfb99f0b06757a26aa5ae2739c926111aab99fd4ed9e6", "ja": "あっ、そっち焦げちゃうよ。\nやよいも、どんどん食べて！", "zh": "啊，那边要烤焦了哦。\n弥生也多吃点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "febcc7276906453c1fa5d0210073048f1ec0e3ff38c82cd5779daa4a9ec638f6", "ja": "（開放的な雰囲気のせいか、みんなよく食べるな……\n肉、少し多めに買ってきて正解だったな）", "zh": "（也许是因为气氛很放松，大家都吃得真多啊……还好买肉的时候特意多买了一些。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "5077364b50f293e2a2e7604600cae9f7369c913cf93ff51ede75432d62bdff87", "ja": "お仕事がたくさんあって忙しい夏休みだったけど、\nなんとか一段落って感じだね。", "zh": "虽然暑假里有很多工作，忙得不可开交，但总算告一段落了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "dea3d49474422567db2d768d61f99af6361eedfb97633fedfb84fab2fa1f9729", "ja": "はい！　私も美術の宿題、ばっちり終わりました！\nみんなのおかげです！", "zh": "好的！我的美术作业也顺利完成了！\n这都多亏了大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "05b106f23ed706b69ee09d578c6db9beac7fbdb3ae791f84cd10ca90367e3a77", "ja": "良かったな。それで、やよいは結局、\nどんな絵を描いたんだ？", "zh": "那就好。不过，弥生最后画了什么画？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "cd3b565860acfdd5457d545dbfd0638afca908ff8702c9d56c9f21a5a46f3cde", "ja": "私は、私の家族が海の近くに住んでたらーって\n想像して、絵を描きました！", "zh": "我想象着“要是我的家人住在海边就好了”，然后画了下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "f86aabf7d49856d8f239361a0f92ab278a499ffe660a1bdc60fd497e3e2f51e9", "ja": "がんばったねって、先生もほめてくれました！\nえへへ……。", "zh": "老师也夸我说“你努力过了呢”！\n嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "ea171a8cc9ae19460c19cf440eda06632b11b8b3662bf71490e36c416740a9ba", "ja": "やよいのおうちが、海の近くだったらかぁ……\nふふ、賑やかで楽しそうだね♪", "zh": "要是弥生家住在海边的话啊……\n呵呵，感觉会很热闹，也很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "d131b22499cb670f592bd93c2421f66ee73889b57b9ce8c61a03456d6eb60452", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。このユニットの\nお仕事って、まだ続くんだよね？　楽しみさー！", "zh": "呐，{$P$}。这个组合的工作还会继续吧？真让人期待呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "0c1c547e6e318a344c00ac3011c12fa5d3983120456212af4ad12288bc496ad8", "ja": "はい！　ユニットが続けられて、私も嬉しいです！\nどんなお仕事が待ってるのかなぁ。", "zh": "是的！还能继续参加这个组合，我也很开心！\n不知道接下来会有什么工作等着我们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "98854b3d4fd9dcc3847304f1443bf58bb0d57e7e8da4cacb90d32843ba0c6051", "ja": "やっぱりロケとか……あっ、{$P$}！\n沖縄に行く仕事ってないの！？", "zh": "果然还是外景什么的……啊，{$P$}！\n有没有去冲绳的工作呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5b29a55c446abd47e8305e1867082e62a1c1f652180a489985fbbd4de04cf9ec", "ja": "沖縄か……。\n残念ながら今のところ予定はないな。", "zh": "冲绳吗……\n很遗憾，目前还没有去那里的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "c1cec56e2346541099f28e674eaeccc2020eeabd05e2e03288ce64e6b8694357", "ja": "ちぇー。やっぱり、海と言ったら沖縄でしょ？\n自分、やよいと春香を沖縄に連れて行きたいぞ！", "zh": "啧。说到大海，果然还是冲绳吧？\n我想带着弥生和春香去冲绳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "7ad7433ead02b178fde9542b3eed4424dd697d3888daa65a9d0ddd1022c2215b", "ja": "それなら別にお仕事じゃなくても、\nみんなで遊びに行けばいいんじゃない？", "zh": "那样的话，就算不是工作，大家一起去玩不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "44b04c42f06af2743e63eec90e2d2942a36897cd9b9d464979228c5029d1500c", "ja": "あっ、そっか！　でもスケジュールが……\nみんな忙しいけど、なんとかして……日帰りで！", "zh": "啊，对哦！不过日程安排……大家都很忙，但想想办法……当天来回！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "b573a91b908e5c4d784f99146ff132f557176f3f923c1feb79ed974363954838", "ja": "沖縄って遠いんですよね、響さん。\n日帰りで行けるんですか？", "zh": "冲绳很远的吧，响姐姐。\n当天往返能行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "321221e8de689ebc1be65abe77e69c30c24ec9a0289f35ad72df4b9fb055c2df", "ja": "あはは。日帰りはさすがに厳しいんじゃないかな……。\n行ってもバタバタしちゃって、楽しめないと思うし。", "zh": "啊哈哈。当天往返未免还是太勉强了吧……\n就算去了也得匆匆忙忙的，我觉得根本玩不尽兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "51dd8551964a39616666560a267b401d9a02dfc95c57d7cfd574aa2777fb0cc8", "ja": "そうだな。それに、最強の海と言うからには、\n余裕のある日程で思いっきり味わってみたいしな！", "zh": "是啊。而且，既然都叫作最强之海了，就想安排宽裕点的日程，尽情享受一番啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "e5014c797dcb62192fa859d6fcd8e49e18307619569f4351fead6fab2ab8eb32", "ja": "そっか！　せっかく最強の海に行くのに、\nちょっとだけじゃもったいないもんね。", "zh": "这样啊！难得要去最棒的大海，\n只待一小会儿也太可惜了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_07_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "afdce49ac3678b52ebcc8d2f4ee99c8ff8bdb7f5fe6d1c781e2ee366762df6d5", "ja": "いつか、いつか絶対に連れて行くから……\n沖縄の海、楽しみにしててよね！", "zh": "总有一天，我一定会带你去的……\n要好好期待冲绳的海哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
